{"4682020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voxborn", "steam_appid": 4682020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a world that feels unfinished — and everything around you can break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxborn is a stylized voxel action RPG focused on emergent gameplay — where combat, destruction, and companion mechanics combine to create dynamic encounters and unpredictable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a series of handcrafted regions, each with its own mood, time of day, and challenges — from calm villages to dangerous ruins and corrupted lands. Every area introduces new mechanics, forcing you to adapt how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this world reacts to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings don’t just stand — they collapse. Explosions reshape the battlefield. Enemies use the same space you do. Every fight becomes a small sandbox of chaos and opportunity — experiment with destruction, positioning, and timing to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal dog companion fights at your side — not as a passive helper, but as a core part of your combat system. Set its behavior, unleash abilities, and create chained attacks between enemies. Plan carefully — or watch everything fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Emergent Combat &amp; Systems</strong><br>Simple systems combine into unpredictable outcomes — no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Destruction-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Break structures piece by piece. Use explosions and terrain to your advantage. The world is part of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Companion Combat System</strong><br>Command your dog through behavior settings and active abilities. Chain attacks between enemies, search for hidden loot, and adapt tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Meaningful Gear &amp; Stats</strong><br>Weapons and equipment come with trade-offs — improving one playstyle while limiting another. Build your character your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Handcrafted Regions &amp; Progression</strong><br>Move through distinct areas gated by challenges, enemies, and puzzles — each introducing new gameplay twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Narrative</strong><br>A strange narrator guides your journey, blurring the line between creator and observer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is unstable. Systems overlap. Things break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you use that to your advantage?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a world that feels unfinished — and everything around you can break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxborn is a stylized voxel action RPG focused on emergent gameplay — where combat, destruction, and companion mechanics combine to create dynamic encounters and unpredictable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a series of handcrafted regions, each with its own mood, time of day, and challenges — from calm villages to dangerous ruins and corrupted lands. Every area introduces new mechanics, forcing you to adapt how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this world reacts to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings don’t just stand — they collapse. Explosions reshape the battlefield. Enemies use the same space you do. Every fight becomes a small sandbox of chaos and opportunity — experiment with destruction, positioning, and timing to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal dog companion fights at your side — not as a passive helper, but as a core part of your combat system. Set its behavior, unleash abilities, and create chained attacks between enemies. Plan carefully — or watch everything fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Emergent Combat &amp; Systems</strong><br>Simple systems combine into unpredictable outcomes — no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Destruction-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Break structures piece by piece. Use explosions and terrain to your advantage. The world is part of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Companion Combat System</strong><br>Command your dog through behavior settings and active abilities. Chain attacks between enemies, search for hidden loot, and adapt tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Meaningful Gear &amp; Stats</strong><br>Weapons and equipment come with trade-offs — improving one playstyle while limiting another. Build your character your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Handcrafted Regions &amp; Progression</strong><br>Move through distinct areas gated by challenges, enemies, and puzzles — each introducing new gameplay twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Narrative</strong><br>A strange narrator guides your journey, blurring the line between creator and observer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is unstable. Systems overlap. Things break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you use that to your advantage?</p>", "short_description": "Voxborn is a stylized voxel action RPG where destruction, combat, and a loyal dog companion create emergent gameplay in a dark, evolving world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682020/4fef04a4de22f35bcb2a75ca9f56e344164d77a2/header.jpg?t=1780267592", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste